{"id":7406004869,"name":"OPPOSER VR [Alpha]","desc":"'OPPOSER VR' is a fast-paced shooter that mixes parkour and gun battles. Featuring multiple game modes, fend for yourself, fight alongside a team, or help the detective scope out the traitors lurking among you.\n\nBasic Quest controls:\nTriggers: Fire / Activate item / Punch / Respawn / Move ammo pouch / Grab slide\nGrip buttons: Grab\nLeft thumbstick click: Reset ammo pouch position (double-tap)\nRight thumbstick down: Open quick-menu\nRight thumbstick left: Rotate left\nRight thumbstick right: Rotate right\nRight thumbstick click: Jump / Jetpack\nLeft thumbstick: Move character\nButton B: Eject right magazine / Private server commands\nButton Y: Eject left magazine\nButton X: Left quick-release / Fire mode\nButton A: Right quick-release / Fire mode\n\nTo remove attachments, hold down the mag eject button and grab while touching the attachment.\nTo slide, put one hand under your torso and crouch while running forward at full speed.\n\nFull changelogs can be viewed in the community server.","path":"/game/7406004869-opposer-vr","slug":"7406004869-opposer-vr","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/93697015f2fff1d97efc1dc11c9eef2e27ed4ef5e6e89ed00bc0d6a80edde622.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b227d1aae7cf043ed17c41f0a3c1f051/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":178,"visitor":34636723,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-31T11:36:52.204Z","creator":{"name":"OVR","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"67e0bd9c8f4e0d29f9a8ef41","title":"Opposed","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7808f","gameId":7406004869,"name":"OPPOSER VR [Alpha]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/93697015f2fff1d97efc1dc11c9eef2e27ed4ef5e6e89ed00bc0d6a80edde622.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b227d1aae7cf043ed17c41f0a3c1f051/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"7406004869-opposer-vr","path":"/game/