r VR.\n2. check if your executor is executing at all while inside of Opposer VR. (use a simple print statement like 'print(\"test\")', and then check the console by pressing f9)","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-04-09T16:36:22.852Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"67f87c0013e0a06ba398116e","commentBy":{"_id":"66f62d59d56dd8085a99d6e8","username":"EnergyBlox","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d3579ad9e9daf55f5eaa1e8d36719406c188536814ec27a536c10e7c97922ace.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66f62d59d56dd8085a99d6e8-1739430851530.png"},"createdAt":"2024-09-27T03:58:17.870Z","lastActive":"2025-04-23T18:14:00.654Z","status":"offline","id":"66f62d59d56dd8085a99d6e8","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.followers","tier":10},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d3579ad9e9daf55f5eaa1e8d36719406c188536814ec27a536c10e7c97922ace.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66f62d59d56dd8085a99d6e8-1739430851530.png"}},"text":"who has a vr executor tho :sob:","edited":false,"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-04-11T02:18:40.374Z","liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"67f88f559ade65d7bfbe5821","commentBy":{"_id":"67ba230b0d0d11fa2d42193d","username":"Opposed_Dev","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0fa2f17b14b202287f095df5107c17f327b4dbb20cb3711ffecaa8e769360ca9.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67ba230b0d0d11fa2d42193d-1745194112476.png"},"createdAt":"2025-02-22T19:18:35.471Z","lastActive":"2025-10-28T23:03:10.488Z","status":"offline","id":"67ba230b0d0d11fa2d42193d","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0fa2f17b14b202287f095df5107c17f327b4dbb20cb3711ffecaa8e769360ca9.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67ba230b0d0d11fa2d42193d-1745194112476.png"}},"text":"@EnergyBlox most executors (Solara, Xeno, Wave, etc.) will w